# C# / MVC Conventions

## Naming
- Classes/methods/properties: PascalCase
- Parameters/locals: camelCase
- Private fields: `_camelCase`
- Interfaces: `I` + PascalCase

## Controllers
```csharp
[Authorize]
public class TaskController : Controller
{
    // Validate first, then business logic
    if (!ModelState.IsValid) return View(model);

    // Filter by current user via repository — never trust client ids alone
}
```

## Data access
- Repositories in `PersonalTaskManager.Infrastructure`
- Entities/enums in `PersonalTaskManager.Core`
- LINQ must include ownership: `Project.UserId == currentUserId`

## Do not
- Query `_context` directly in Views
- Swallow exceptions silently
- Store plain-text passwords
